{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "23ae3e38-67fa-8054-a702-a84689d7a3ac",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T09:37:45-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Gina Fiore",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:35:16-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:35:19-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Kevin, Gina Fiore. Um, so when I was a kid we lived down near the harbor, and every time it rained hard the water came up the street and my father would stand at the window and say the drains in this town were older than he was. Anyway, that's still true, apparently."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So what's going on, a drain issue?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:35:41-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. There's a catch basin at the corner by 256 Admiral Kalbfus Road, up in the North End. It's totally clogged with leaves, and since the nor'easter Friday and Saturday, two days ago, the water backs right up into the driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 256 Admiral Kalbfus. Catch basin at the corner, clogged with leaves. How deep is the water getting?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "About up to the hubcaps on a regular car. It's down a little now but it doesn't drain, it just sits there. I manage the property, so I've got tenants coming and going through that driveway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:36:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, hubcap deep, writing that down. And is it the basin right at the corner, not one farther up the road?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:36:23-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right at the corner. Sorry, hang on, I'm peeling a label off a jar here while I talk, it's not coming off. Okay. Yes, the corner one. The grate is covered in wet leaves, you can barely see it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:36:37-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. I'll put in a work order for a crew to clear that basin. Do the crews work on weekends? I mean, I know you're asking me, but I'll tell you, they can, when it's a storm cleanup, but it depends on what's backed up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, actually that was going to be my question. Do the crews work weekends? Because if it's not getting done this week I'd want to know."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sometimes, yeah, after a big storm they'll put people on a Saturday. But this is Monday morning, so I'd expect it gets looked at this week, probably in the next few days."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:13-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that works. Should I do anything in the meantime?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:17-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just keep cars out of the low spot if you can. And if the water starts coming toward a building, call us right back. Want me to take a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:30-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0155."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:32-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-five. Got it. So, 256 Admiral Kalbfus, clogged corner basin, water to the hubcaps in the driveway. That's all in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:40-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T09:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet, Gina. Take care."
    }
  ],
